Now that <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> AI is ready to launch in <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipados-27/">iPadOS 27</a>, and macOS 27 Golden Gate, Apple can finally introduce new smart home products built to work with the smarter version of &zwnj;Siri&zwnj;.<br/>
<br/>
